'''Geno''' ([[IPA]]: /dʒɛno/; [[Genonian language|Genonian]]: 𐑡𐑧𐑯𐑭, ''Ĝeno''), officially the '''Transhumanist Republic of Geno''', is a country in the continent of [[Visala]] on the planet [[Basis]]. 

Geno covers TBD square kilometers, and is the ??th-largest country in Basis by land area. With a population exceeding 83 million, Geno is the ??th-most populous country in Basis. Its capital and largest city is [[Utopia]], a planned city. 

Geno is an authoritarian one-party state with a government led by the [[Transhumanist Party]] (THP). The country's official ideology is [[Transhumanism]], a doctrine based on [[wikipedia:eugenics|eugenics]] and [[wikipedia:natalism|natalism]] developed by [[DUDE]]. This transhumanist regime operates according to a totalitarian logic and has one of the lowest levels of human rights in Basis, according to [[SOME HUMAN RIGHTS NGO]]. 

Geno is a [[wikipedia:newly industrialized country|middle-income country]], with [[List of countries in Basis by GDP (nominal)|??th-largest economy in Basis by nominal GDP]] and the [[List of countries in Basis by GDP (PPP)|??th-largest by purchasing power parity (PPP)]]. [[International sanctions against Geno|International sanctions]] have forced Geno to develop a robust domestic market for most goods. It is considered to be a [[wikipedia:regional power|regional power]] in [[Visala]] and a [[wikipedia:middle power|middle power]] throughout [[Basis]]. 

