==History==
===Prehistory (before {{abbr|471 BCE|391 BCE (Earth Year Equivalent)}})===
Archeological stuff. 

===Antiquity ({{abbr|471 BCE|391 BCE (Earth Year Equivalent)}}–{{abbr|431 CE|358 CE (Earth Year Equivalent)}})===
Proto-Genonian tribes move in from somewhere else, while empires/kingdoms control the area. Geno is not a cradle to any civilization though. 

===Early Genonian kingdoms ({{abbr|431|358 (Earth Year Equivalent)}}–{{abbr|1127|936 (Earth Year Equivalent)}})===
Various small kingdoms exist in present-day Geno. Most are polytheist or some other religion. 

===Rise of Anist states ({{abbr|1127|936 (Earth Year Equivalent)}}–{{abbr|1771|1471 (Earth Year Equivalent)}})===
Neighboring Anist states come in and kill a lot of people, spreading the one faith. 

===Dynastic era ({{abbr|1771|1471 (Earth Year Equivalent)}}–{{abbr|2102|1746 (Earth Year Equivalent)}})===
Various Anist royal families from the region control Geno at this time. Could also be part of some large empire. 

===Kingdom of Geno ({{abbr|2102|1746 (Earth Year Equivalent)}}–{{abbr|2268|1884 (Earth Year Equivalent)}})===
Breakaway Kingdom following some war; could be a foreign power's protectorate. Single Genonian royal family rules until 2268 and they suck, with the population remaining poor. Big diaspora starts in that era. Genonian language and national identity is established a bit like French/Italian. 

===Genonian Revolution ({{abbr|2268|1884 (Earth Year Equivalent)}}–{{abbr|2328|1934 (Earth Year Equivalent)}})===
{{Main|Genonian Revolution}}

Revolution against the monarchy; establishment of democracy and a modern state. Heavy focus on modernizing and adopting international customs creates tension with traditionalists. Diaspora continues but slows down in the 24th century. 

===Transhumanist Revolution ({{abbr|2328|1934 (Earth Year Equivalent)}}–present)===
{{Main|Transhumanist Revolution}}

Modernist revolution led by "10th President"/"Mustache Guy" after being elected democratically. Changes the country's official name and constitution, and then they do a lot of fucked up shit. Rise in quality of life and population, though, but at a heavy human cost. 

