===Foreign Relations===
Considered a [[wikipedia:pariah state|pariah state]] globally, Geno does not have diplomatic relations with most countries. 

Some countries, including [[Qym]], have designated the [[Transhumanist Party]] as a terrorist organization. 

===Military===
{{Main|Genonian Armed Forces}}

[[Conscription in Geno|Military service is required]] for all male citizens and is fixed at {{abbr|age 22|age 18 (Earth Year Equivalent)}} after which they serve for {{abbr|two years|one year and eight months (Earth Year Equivalent)}}, followed by reserve duty until {{abbr|age 70|age 58 (Earth Year Equivalent)}}. Conscientious objections are not recognized and there is no civilian alternative to military service. 

In {{abbr|2440|2027 (Earth Year Equivalent)}}, Geno's military expenditure totaled approximately $82.25 billion, or around 17.3 percent of the country's gross domestic product, placing it [[List of countries by military expenditures|?th for military expenditure worldwide]]. 

===Human rights===
{{Main|Human rights in Geno|LGBTQ rights in Geno}}

Geno's human rights record is considered one of the worst in the world. Humans rights are supposedly guaranteed, subject to fulfillment of the citizens' duties to [[Protect the Future]], as enshrined in the constitution. 

A Genonian man's duty is to protect his country's future through military and community service. Men must serve in the military for {{abbr|two years|one year and eight months (Earth Year Equivalent)}} from {{abbr|age 22|age 18 (Earth Year Equivalent)}} to {{abbr|age 24|age 20 (Earth Year Equivalent)}} and be on various forms of reserve until {{abbr|age 70|age 58 (Earth Year Equivalent)}}. 

A Genonian woman's duty is to protect her country's future through childbearing and community service. Women must minimally give birth to 3 abled citizens during their most fertile period between {{abbr|age 24|age 20 (Earth Year Equivalent)}} and {{abbr|age 42|age 35 (Earth Year Equivalent)}}. 

LGBTQ+ rights are non-existent as the constitution only recognizes two gender identities, men and women, and one sexual orientation, heterosexual. Sexual minorities are treated as mentally ill people and either go through conversion therapy or forced sterilization.

